---
title: Tested artifacts and automatic GitHub release without deployment
query: >-
  Show the implemented CI and release-only flow. Distinguish PR validation from protected-main publication, parallel
  foundation/product checks from the terminal control-plane gate, and the same-run exact tested image export from
  publication. Include frozen baseline verification, complete acceptance, immutable artifact/provenance checks,
  version/tag identity, draft asset verification and safe identical retries. Do not add deployment, registry push,
  provider provisioning or production approval; those are absent from the current release implementation.
  For the current integrated application, show independent Docker image builds, the two running Compose containers
  and host acceptance processes, then export of those exact tested images. Images and archives are artifacts, not
  extra running services. Earlier source-only phases have a separate foundation-delivery path outside this view.
references:
  - "File: /.github/workflows/ci.yml"
  - "File: /scripts/run-ci-phase.mjs"
  - "File: /scripts/ci-gate.mjs"
  - "File: /scripts/publish-release-bundle.mjs"
  - "File: /scripts/prepare-release.mjs"
  - "File: /scripts/publish-release.mjs"
  - "File: /scripts/publish-release-evidence.mjs"
  - "File: /scripts/release-manifest.mjs"
---
flowchart TD
    EVENT["Current integrated application: PR or protected-main push"] --> F["Foundation: format, lint, policy, portability, Mermaid and tooling tests"]
    EVENT --> P["Product: verify frozen baseline and run unit/build checks"]
    P --> BUILD["Build two independent Docker images<br/>frontend: static assets with NGINX<br/>API: TypeScript build stage to minimal Node runtime"]
    BUILD --> TEST["Run frontend and API as two Compose containers<br/>host Playwright/Chromium tests their real HTTP boundary"]
    TEST --> KIND{"Successful application main push?"}
    KIND -->|"Yes"| B["Export exact tested images on producing runner; upload immutable same-run bundle"]
    KIND -->|"PR"| RESULT["No application bundle export"]
    F --> G{"Terminal gate: all mandatory jobs succeeded?"}
    B --> G
    RESULT --> G
    G -->|"No"| STOP["Fail checks; no release"]
    G -->|"Yes"| MAIN{"Protected-main push?"}
    MAIN -->|"No: PR"| REVIEW["Checks available for human review and protected merge"]
    MAIN -->|"Yes: verified application bundle"| VERIFY["Serialized publisher verifies source, baseline, same-run checks and bundle hashes"]
    VERIFY --> DRAFT["Create or verify exact v0.1.ordinal tag and private draft release"]
    DRAFT --> ASSETS["Upload missing assets; verify every size and SHA-256"]
    ASSETS --> RELEASE["Publish verified GitHub release: released-not-deployed"]
    VERIFY -.->|"Mismatch"| FAIL["Stop and preserve state; never overwrite conflicting content"]
    DRAFT -.->|"Conflict or interruption"| FAIL
    ASSETS -.->|"Failure"| FAIL
    FAIL -.->|"Retry only with identical source and bytes"| VERIFY
